    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kane, a chivalrous knight, was cursed as a child while saving a young girl, losing fragments of his memory in the process. Years later, clad in armor that suppresses the curse, he returns to his hometown in search of what was lost\u2014only to discover his house has been taken over by a mischievous demon girl.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625110/extras/26662c2b92e81cd5b0b2075ee4a5435c.avif?t=1755461542\" width=1278 height=533 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A horned demon girl with a playful streak, often hiding her true feelings behind teasing remarks. Repressed for many years, she has developed an unusual fixation on collecting certain naughty items.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625110/extras/61bdd757a451eda7dbce16909ac0813c.avif?t=1755461542\" width=1183 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coco</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lively catgirl with fluffy ears who openly expresses her affection for the one she cares about. She loves grilled fish and has waited by the riverside for her master\u2019s return for ten years.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an RPG focused on adventure and combat, with adult elements making up only a part of the content, unlocked gradually as the story progresses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features turn-based battles and includes two different endings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Chapter 3, players can collect 15 types of naughty items, which can also be fully collected at once after completing the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
